# I — what the Endowment publishes about "inventory": its holdings by asset class at 30 June 2025 (audited fair values). It holds no goods, no SKUs and no listings; the
# fund is invested in index funds (Level 1 fair-value inputs). The manager and custodian are not named on the pages read.
